{
  "url": "https://colorroasters.com/products/primary-seasonal-blend",
  "product": {
    "id": 1369060966459,
    "title": "Primary (Our Seasonal Blend)",
    "body_html": "<h1 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: 'Open Sans'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Open Sans'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Open Sans'; color: #000000;\">SEASONAL BLEND</span></h1>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 12.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 2;\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 26.0pt; font-family: Helvetica; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Open Sans'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Open Sans'; color: #000000;\"><span>PRIMARY</span></span></b></p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\"><strong>MILK CHOCOLATE, DARK FRUIT, CARAMEL SWEETNESS | SMOOTH FINISH</strong></p>\n<p data-end=\"483\" data-start=\"396\">Primary is our house blend. Our most popular coffee. The one we built cafes with. </p>\n<p data-end=\"652\" data-start=\"485\">It’s balanced, sweet, and endlessly drinkable — with milk chocolate richness, dark fruit depth, and a caramel sweetness that carries through to a smooth, clean finish.</p>\n<p data-end=\"842\" data-start=\"654\">Primary is built for versatility. It shines as espresso and holds structure beautifully in milk. It’s equally expressive as a brewed cup. This is the coffee you can come back to every day.</p>\n<h3 data-end=\"853\" data-start=\"844\">Roast</h3>\n<p data-end=\"860\" data-start=\"854\">Medium</p>\n<h3 data-end=\"885\" data-start=\"862\">What’s in the Blend</h3>\n<p data-end=\"1004\" data-start=\"886\">A rotating, two-part blend of fresh harvest coffees we love — always seasonally adjusted to stay consistent in flavor.</p>\n<ul data-end=\"1125\" data-start=\"1006\">\n<li data-end=\"1061\" data-start=\"1006\">\n<p data-end=\"1061\" data-start=\"1008\"><strong data-end=\"1028\" data-start=\"1008\">December – June:</strong> Organic Peru + Huila, Colombia</p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"1125\" data-start=\"1062\">\n<p data-end=\"1125\" data-start=\"1064\"><strong data-end=\"1084\" data-start=\"1064\">July – November:</strong> Organic Mexico + Nicaragua or Honduras</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-end=\"1241\" data-start=\"1127\">We change origins with the harvest, not the flavor profile. The goal is simple: keep Primary tasting like Primary.</p>",
    "product_type": "Coffee",
    "handle": "primary-seasonal-blend",
    "tags": "Best Selling, blend, espresso, mexico, Peru, primary",
