50,\"price\":9000,\"name\":\"Primary (Our Seasonal Blend) - Cold Brew / 5 LBS.\",\"public_title\":\"Cold Brew / 5 LBS.\",\"sku\":\"\"}],\"remote\":false}};</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org/\",\"@type\":\"Product\",\"name\":\"Primary (Our Seasonal Blend)\",\"url\":\"https://colorroasters.com/products/primary-seasonal-blend\",\"image\":[\"https://colorroasters.com/cdn/shop/files/Primary_1000x.png?v=1720812335\"],\"description\":\"SEASONAL BLEND\\nPRIMARY\\nMILK CHOCOLATE, DARK FRUIT, CARAMEL SWEETNESS | SMOOTH FINISH\\nPrimary is our house blend. Our most popular coffee. The one we built cafes with. \\nIt’s balanced, sweet, and endlessly drinkable — with milk chocolate richness, dark fruit depth, and a caramel sweetness that carries through to a smooth, clean finish.\\nPrimary is built for versatility. It shines as espresso and holds structure beautifully in milk. It’s equally expressive as a brewed cup. This is the coffee you can come back to every day.\\nRoast\\nMedium\\nWhat’s in the Blend\\nA rotating, two-part blend of fresh harvest coffees we love — always seasonally adjusted to stay consistent in flavor.\\n\\n\\nDecember – June: Organic Peru + Huila, Colombia\\n\\n\\nJuly – November: Organic Mexico + Nicaragua or Honduras\\n\\n\\nWe change origins with the harvest, not the flavor profile. The goal is simple: keep Primary tasting like Primary.\",\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Thing\",\"name\":\"Color Coffee Roasters\"},\"offers\":[{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\",\"price\":18,\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://colorroasters.com/products/primary-seasonal-blend?variant=12719944138811\"},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\",\"price\":48,\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://colorroasters.com/products/primary-seasonal-blend?variant=45253501714570\"},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\",\"price\":90,\"priceCurrency\":\"